    ],
    "text": "Finally, we perform sensitivity analysis on the hyperparameters and in Temporal Cham- pagne Tower Model. The maximum variation ranges of the model results caused by the changes of and are 0.041 and 0.028, respectively, which indicates that our model has a strong robustness."
  },
